## Interface: 16001, 120105, 120107
## Title: ARL Extensions: Quality of Life
## Notes: Sleeping Bag reminders, XP Food, Fishing Pole Alert, Spec Gear Swap, LFG Role Filter, Leveling BiS Spec, Auto Uprank, Quick Loot, Loot Sparkles, Buff Back, Layer Bridge and Share Location.
## Author: aredpanda, andreg1
## Version: 0.10.8
## Group: ARLExtensions
## Dependencies: ARLExtensions
## OptionalDeps: ForeverLevelingBiS, AutoLayer, LayerSwap
## LoadOnDemand: 1
## X-ARLE-Pack: QoL
## X-ARLE-Group: QualityOfLife
## X-ARLE-Features: SleepingBag, XPFood, FishingPoleAlert, SpecGearSwap, LFGRoleFilter, LevelingBiSSpec, AutoUprank, QuickLoot, LootSparkles, BuffBack, LayerBridge, ShareLocation
## X-ARLE-Feature-SleepingBag: title=Sleeping Bag; cmd=bag; default=off; replaces=ForeverSleepingBag
## X-ARLE-Feature-XPFood: title=XP Food; cmd=food; default=off; replaces=ForeverSnackTrack
## X-ARLE-Feature-FishingPoleAlert: title=Fishing Pole Alert; cmd=fish; default=off; replaces=FishingPoleAlert
## X-ARLE-Feature-SpecGearSwap: title=Spec Gear Swap; cmd=gear; default=off; replaces=SpecGearSwap
## X-ARLE-Feature-LFGRoleFilter: title=LFG Role Filter; cmd=lfg; default=off; replaces=LFGRoleFilter
## X-ARLE-Feature-LevelingBiSSpec: title=Leveling BiS Spec; extends=ForeverLevelingBiS; group=ForeverLevelingBiS; cmd=spec; default=off; replaces=ForeverLevelingBiS_AutoSpec
## X-ARLE-Feature-AutoUprank: title=Auto Uprank; cmd=uprank; default=off
## X-ARLE-Feature-QuickLoot: title=Quick Loot; cmd=loot; default=off
## X-ARLE-Feature-LootSparkles: title=Loot Sparkles; cmd=sparkle; default=off; replaces=ForeverLootSparkles
## X-ARLE-Feature-BuffBack: title=Buff Back; cmd=buff; default=off; replaces=Manners
## X-ARLE-Feature-LayerBridge: title=Layer Bridge; cmd=layer; default=off
## X-ARLE-Feature-ShareLocation: title=Share Location; cmd=share

